{"overview":"«عجله کن، برادر!» یک برنامهٔ واریتهٔ چینی است که بر پایهٔ برنامهٔ واریتهٔ کره‌ای «رانینگ من» ساخته شده؛ توسط SBS تولید و با تلویزیون ژجیانگ هم‌تولید شده و اولین بار در ۱۰ اکتبر ۲۰۱۴ پخش شد. این برنامه به‌عنوان یک برنامهٔ بازی‑واریته طبقه‌بندی می‌شود که مجریان و مهمانان در مکان‌های مشهور مأموریت‌ها را انجام می‌دهند تا در مسابقه پیروز شوند؛ در سال ۲۰۱۷ نام رسمی آن به «کیپ رانینگ» تغییر یافت.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Hurry Up, Brother! is a Chinese variety show based off the original Korean variety show, Running Man. It is created by SBS and co-produced with Zhejiang Television. It first aired on October 10, 2014. This show is classified as a game-variety show, where the MCs and guests complete missions in a landmark to win a race. In 2017, the show officially changed its name to \"Keep Running\".","tagline_en":"","runtime":90,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":117,"y":2015,"poster":"/4E7WmqgOTql4CZMoabEigL0s4tr.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":15,"y":2014,"poster":"/8STVpJQuboZQvS1jgFLbufyEIyc.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2015,"poster":"/wdWGakGnkFxzZeIimrqCD9SFX5m.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":12,"y":2015,"poster":"/7uagBmia8i9bdPoAdZgxLD5GEY2.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":12,"y":2016,"poster":"/a7vRzchHldOneJTFwlaRvZ82lYL.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":12,"y":2017,"poster":"/lnmSUD6Kz5GS8RbD33J96xOWoi7.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":12,"y":2018,"poster":"/aB5Rs2NqU3jlixsirlaeYQhVh1G.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":12,"y":2019,"poster":"/ftOlaMxlL1Szdjn16K4mY7cRFgY.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":12,"y":2020,"poster":"/9tiKHJyIYBlEfUCV4mleaD3J64l.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":13,"y":2021,"poster":"/4kRcBrP0sS1Xrs3pTG3tkLGPD0m.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":12,"y":2022,"poster":"/xPZOK6o72xfXIScyZY5UHx6vRDx.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":12,"y":2023,"poster":"/7dRs4oPPrHxhU1z9Bu37WCcUMZW.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":12,"y":2024,"poster":"/vIQgD6PkhaZTdxp4GZqsh0LajF8.jpg"},{"n":13